10. Design-Build-Test-Learn Integration

Adaptive Programmable Therapeutics is compatible with the AI-driven design-build-test-learn paradigm. The biological engineering loop becomes:

\text{Design} \rightarrow \text{Build} \rightarrow \text{Test} \rightarrow \text{Learn} \rightarrow \text{Design}.

Adaptive Programmable Therapeutics extends this by adding an explicit control-theoretic layer:

\text{Design} \rightarrow \text{Predict} \rightarrow \text{Verify} \rightarrow \text{Test} \rightarrow \text{Observe} \rightarrow \text{Update}.

The predictive verification step is what distinguishes Adaptive Programmable Therapeutics from open-loop design-build-test-learn cycles.

